font-medium\">PSU</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">19v 150w AC Adapter brick (2.5mm x 5.5mm barrel jack)</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Storage</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">512GB Fanxiang S500 Pro NVME PCIe Gen 3.0</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Storage 2</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">512GB TeamGroup T-Force SATA SSD</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Extras</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Intel AX200 WiFi6 card, Eightwood antenna kit, 40mm x 10mm exhaust fan</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">Thermals</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4\">Ambient: <!-- -->23<!-- -->°C</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Part</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Idle</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Gaming</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Stress</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">apu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>35<!-- -->–<!-- -->40<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>55<!-- -->–<!-- -->65<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>82<!-- -->–<!-- -->87<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">4w</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">4,163</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">5<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">457</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">911</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">5<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">225</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">5<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">419</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">54</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">5<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,053</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">41.8</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">4w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">489</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">19.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">4w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">594</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">10.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">4w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">373</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">6.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">4w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">This ultra-compact thin-ITX build demonstrates the extreme space constraints and thermal limitations of 1.68L form factors. The Goodisory MX01 Clone requires a CPU cooler of 27mm or less and only accommodates thin-ITX motherboards with 23mm IO shields. The 35W TDP Ryzen 5 Pro 3400GE was chosen specifically for its low power envelope, drawing less than 20W in actual use. Performance is deliberately limited—YouTube at 1080p is marginal, better at 720p. Gaming is restricted to low-resource e-sports or classic titles at reduced settings. The build excels in niche applications like video monitoring, Plex servers, or light productivity with 32GB SODIMM RAM. Cooling relies on the low-profile CPU cooler intake and a single 40mm exhaust fan; vertical orientation is recommended. Storage uses PCIe Gen 3 NVMe and SATA SSD due to CPU compatibility constraints. Overall verdict: not recommended as a general desktop PC, but suitable for specialized industrial applications, minimal gaming, and media consumption tasks.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">4,163</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:1%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->99<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">832.6</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">8<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">19.4<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->100<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">4.85</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-10\"><div class=\"max-w-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm\">ComponentWatch</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real-time PC component price tracking and community-verified SFF build data.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-14 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Prices</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">r/sffpc ↗</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto