the extreme space constraints and thermal limitations of 1.68L form factors. The Goodisory MX01 Clone requires a CPU cooler of 27mm or less and only accommodates thin-ITX motherboards with 23mm IO shields. The 35W TDP Ryzen 5 Pro 3400GE was chosen specifically for its low power envelope, drawing less than 20W in actual use. Performance is deliberately limited—YouTube at 1080p is marginal, better at 720p. Gaming is restricted to low-resource e-sports or classic titles at reduced settings. The build excels in niche applications like video monitoring, Plex servers, or light productivity with 32GB SODIMM RAM. Cooling relies on the low-profile CPU cooler intake and a single 40mm exhaust fan; vertical orientation is recommended. Storage uses PCIe Gen 3 NVMe and SATA SSD due to CPU compatibility constraints. Overall verdict: not recommended as a general desktop PC, but suitable for specialized industrial applications, minimal gaming, and media consumption tasks.\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Performance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"CPU — CB23 Multi\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"4,163\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"h-full rou